00:23:11.110 --> 00:23:15.010
Once you've enjoyed that
participants' wall you can then

00:23:15.010 --> 00:23:25.680
navigate to see the next
participants' Please make sure

00:23:25.680 --> 00:23:31.260
you visit all the different
walls and see where all these

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:35.400
amazing people are coming
from, what is their story,

00:23:35.400 --> 00:23:40.170
and how they relate
to Trapped project.

00:23:40.170 --> 00:23:45.180
At any time, if you want to
