00:23:52.410 --> 00:23:55.350
Or as I would like to
call it the opening wall.

00:24:02.180 --> 00:24:05.330
In the end, I want
to thank all of you

00:24:05.330 --> 00:24:08.840
for joining me today
for this opening.

00:24:08.840 --> 00:24:11.540
I also want to
thank everyone who

00:24:11.540 --> 00:24:15.290
participated in this
project one way or another

00:24:15.290 --> 00:24:19.160
I want to thank [INAUDIBLE]
for designing the exhibition.

00:24:19.160 --> 00:24:23.090
And also my amazing
professors and mentors

00:24:23.090 --> 00:24:27.800
Laura and [INAUDIBLE] for
helping me, mentoring me,

00:24:27.800 --> 00:24:30.300
and guiding me
through this journey.

00:24:30.300 --> 00:24:30.800
Thank you.

